inct ghost types to the game. To ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T22:21:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679445","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4909250-1845383656375780","game_id":"steam-4909250","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is Live Now!!","summary":"The Midnight Moving Crew Demo is officially playable on Steam, and we need you and your crew on shift!What’s in the Demo?Grab your friends and step into the shoes of midnight movers. Take on chaotic moving contracts, carry heavy furniture together, maneuver through tricky doorways, and try not to break too much stuff in the process. It’s co-op moving mayhem at night!Grab Your Friends & Play NowThe demo is available to download today!Play Co-op: Rally your friends for maximum coordination (and gu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T22:57:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656375780","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4909250-1844115010497489","game_id":"steam-4909250","kind":"announcement","title":"PLAYTEST IS LIVE!","summary":"Attention, Crew Members!We’re officially opening the doors for our Closed Beta Playtest, and we need fresh recruits to step into the haunted halls and get packing.If you’re ready to test your skills, dodge aggressive entities, and see if you can carry a couch under extreme spectral pressure, now is your chance!How to Join:Head to the Midnight Moving Crew Steam store page.Scroll down to \"Join the Midnight Moving Crew Playtest\".Click \"Request Access\".We’ll be letting players in in batches! Your fe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T16:52:24Z","time_precision":"min